00:01:24.960 --> 00:01:27.460
So there are significant
continued and emerging

00:01:27.460 --> 00:01:28.980
challenges that we face.

00:01:28.980 --> 00:01:31.830
We all know that data is growing
at a really, really fast rate

00:01:31.830 --> 00:01:33.150
for a variety of reasons.

00:01:33.150 --> 00:01:35.760
Generally, we're
spiraling towards a future

00:01:35.760 --> 00:01:39.930
where the digital world is
overtaking our entire storage

00:01:39.930 --> 00:01:42.020
infrastructure, where
creation, modification,

00:01:42.020 --> 00:01:46.670
distribution of digital assets
is becoming easier and easier.

00:01:46.670 --> 00:01:49.880
But at the same time, budgets
for storing and protecting

00:01:49.880 --> 00:01:52.750
that data are not changing
or at least not as quickly

00:01:52.750 --> 00:01:54.610
as the data itself is growing.

00:01:54.610 --> 00:01:58.380
The classic do more with less
drumbeat in IT continues.

00:01:58.380 --> 00:02:00.520
Another growing
